## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design end-to-end tests for both REST and streaming paths, covering data correctness, ordering guarantees, resilience under failures, and secure token handling in real-time systems.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end testing across REST and WebSocket paths
- Message ordering and deduplication in streaming
- Reconnection/backoff strategies under churn
- Cross-service data consistency with upstream feeds
- Cache fallback and mid-stream token rotation handling

